    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">oxygen mole fraction</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A composition characteristic expressing the volume occupied by oxygen divided by the stated total reference volume.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Oxygen Volume Fraction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This characteristic can be selected as a workflow parameter through a Parameter record; contextual parameter use does not alter its intrinsic classification.</skos:scopeNote>
