    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">λ_ca</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">λ_cathode</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Ratio of the molar oxygen supply rate to the cathode to the stoichiometric oxygen-consumption rate corresponding to the operating current; for a single hydrogen fuel cell the latter is I/(4F).</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Cathode Stoichiometric Ratio</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This characteristic can be selected as a workflow parameter through a Parameter record; contextual parameter use does not alter its intrinsic classification.</skos:scopeNote>
