    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Anode Stoichiometric Ratio</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">Ratio of the molar hydrogen supply rate to the anode to the stoichiometric hydrogen-consumption rate corresponding to the operating current; for a single hydrogen fuel cell the latter is I/(2F).</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:provenance xml:lang="en">Migrated from the asserted H2KG v1 source through the versioned taxonomy registry.</dcterms:provenance>
